  "cues": [
    {
      "start": 2.71,
      "end": 5.76,
      "text": "To a nurse, finding a vein can be routine."
    },
    {
      "start": 5.71,
      "end": 8.59,
      "text": "For a patient, it can feel like a long wait."
    },
    {
      "start": 8.55,
      "end": 10.08,
      "text": "Sometimes painful."
    },
    {
      "start": 10.1,
      "end": 14.68,
      "text": "But sometimes, the technology meant to help\nstill leaves the moment frustrating."
    },
    {
      "start": 14.990000000000002,
      "end": 19.09,
      "text": "Because behind every vein\nis a person waiting to feel reassured."
    },
    {
      "start": 21.18,
      "end": 24.419999999999998,
      "text": "Then another nurse noticed \u2014\nand offered a different way."
    },
    {
      "start": 27.22,
      "end": 29.079977324263037,
      "text": "She picked up VeinVision."
    },
    {
      "start": 33.36,
      "end": 36.36,
      "text": "And this time, she could see\nthe veins more clearly."
    },
    {
      "start": 40.56,
      "end": 42.97,
      "text": "Less hesitation. Less waiting."
    },
    {
      "start": 42.660000000000004,
      "end": 45.32,
      "text": "And a patient who feels\na little more at ease."
    },
    {
      "start": 53.010000000000005,
      "end": 55.39000000000001,
      "text": "When you can see better,\nyou can care better."
    }
  ]
}